{"id":"en_the-better-marriage","title":"The Better Marriage","titleEn":"The Better Marriage","description":"Claire Linwood discovers that her marriage rested on deception, and that her closest friend had taken her position as Mrs. Sutton. She chooses to leave it all behind and instead weds Mark Sterling, a man of considerable influence. Their union starts as a practical arrangement, yet it gradually deepens into genuine affection as the two face and surmount every obstacle in their path. Meanwhile, her former husband is left to grapple with regret. Those interested in following the series can do so on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-better-marriage/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-better-marriage/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["CEO","Faceslapping","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnf14/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-better-marriage_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnf14/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-better-marriage_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnf14/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-better-marriage_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnf14/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-better-marriage_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnf14/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-better-marriage_5","title